{
  "slug": "image-background-remover",
  "name": "Image Background Remover",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Chompute Image Background Remover lets Claude remove backgrounds from local images or image URLs and save the result as a transparent PNG. Use it for product photos, profile images, marketing assets, ecommerce listings, presentations, documentation, and quick visual cleanup workflows directly from Claude Code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `chompute-bg-remover` (Remove image backgrounds using Chompute's API, producing transparent PNG output).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install image-background-remover@claude-community` from `dragonfruit-ai/skills` (`plugins/image-background-remover`).\n\nUse this plugin when an AI agent needs to remove an image background, isolate a subject, cut out a product or person, or create a transparent PNG from a local image file or image URL.",
